whisperless — bundled upstream components
========================================

This directory contains a modified copy of `ws_server.py` from:

    Confucius4-R2T2: A Low Latency and High Accuracy Real-Time Speech Recognition Model
    https://github.com/netease-youdao/Confucius4-R2T2
    Copyright 2026 The NetEase Youdao team.
    License: Apache-2.0 (see LICENSE in this directory)

Modifications (also marked with `# patched` inline):
  * Engine init arguments made environment-configurable
    (GPU_MEM_UTIL, MAX_MODEL_LEN) and sized for GPUs shared with a desktop
    (upstream hardcodes 0.95 / 65536).
  * max_new_tokens raised from 1 to 1024 so the offline transcribe() finalize
    has a usable decode budget.
  * The EOS handler re-decodes the full utterance offline and returns the
    complete punctuated transcript (streaming finish never emits terminal
    punctuation), falling back to the streaming finish on error.
  * The offline finalize passes the request's context prompt (so it matches
    the streaming decode) and its output is sanitized: R2T2 emits a trailing
    '|' continuation marker (and sometimes newlines) which must not be typed
    verbatim (wtype renders \n as Return).
  * Decode/engine/VAD knobs made environment-configurable: CHUNK_SIZE_MS,
    LOOKAHEAD_MS, UNFIX_TOKEN_NUM, ROLLBACK_PUNCTUATION, MAX_NEW_TOKENS,
    TEMPERATURE/REPETITION_PENALTY (finalize sampling), MAX_NUM_SEQS,
    KV_CACHE_DTYPE, MAX_NUM_BATCHED_TOKENS, VAD_* (speech threshold and
    speech/silence frame limits).
  * VAD detection is skipped when the client disables it (upstream always ran
    detect_chunk and ignored the result), and streaming calls pass
    rollback_punctuation explicitly (upstream passed nmt_fast positionally
    into that parameter).
  * Full-utterance PCM accumulation (full_pcm_list) for the offline finalize,
    including the final sub-chunk remainder, padded with 0.6s of silence
    (the model drops the last word when audio ends right after it).
  * Batch mode: a "streaming": false header field skips the per-chunk decode
    and only accumulates audio for the EOS finalize (default true = upstream
    behavior; use_vad forces streaming).

These changes are provided under the Apache-2.0 license, consistent with the
